From ba6f8a2b92c08b7605fd0242c61a6e7a5c819870 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 04:10:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(rust-rounds): name a point's refusal by its field, and
 match a send to its takes' refs (RR24)

Two findings from server#998's review:

- essay: a point an essay answers on its own is refused at
  `tickets[i].points[j].answer.kind`, its own field, not by its place
  among the combined items (`Essay.points`, `PointAnswer`).
- sent: a send's answer must name the ticket, and point, its take's own
  `ref` says (`sent::take_refs`, `voice_repo::ref_of`); a take held as
  said for another ticket, point or kind is a 422 at `answers[i].take`.
  A take home does not hold yet is not refused, as before.

Change-Kind: story
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
